        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ezira yeeyama ebionoono biaIsiraeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho khunyanga yamakhumi kabili nakhane eyomumwesi kwenokwo, abaana baIsiraeli nibakhung'aana, halala nokhuhonga inzala, nokhwifwala tsingubo tsiamakunia, nokhwipuuka liloba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo abolwibulo lwaIsiraeli nibeekabukhasia nabarende bosi, nibasinjila nibeeyama ebionoono biabwe, nobumayaanu bwabakuuka babwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibasinjila ewa bali, nibasooma akomushitabu shiamalako kOMWAMI Nyasaye wabwe mushitonye shiakhane shieinyanga; mushitonye shindi shiakhane nibeeyama, nibamwinamila OMWAMI Nyasaye wabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana abandu bano nibasinjila khumaniinilo kabaLawi; mbu Yeswa, Bani, Kadimieli, Shebania, Buni, Sherebia, Bani, naKhenani; nibahaabila OMWAMI Nyasaye wabwe, nomwoyo omukhongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana abaLawi, mbu Yeswa, Kadimieli, Bani, Hashabuneya, Sherebia, Hodia, Shebania, naPetsahia, nibaboola mbu Sinjile, mumwitsoomie OMWAMI Nyasaye weenywe okhurula khubumeli okhuula khubumeli. Eliiralio lioluyali liitsoomibwe, elichinguukha okhuyomba obwitsoomii bwosi nende obupaachi bwosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ManaEzira nasunga mbu Iwe niwe OMWAMI, iwe wenyene; niwe owalonga likulu, nelikulu elili mwikulu, halala namahe kalio kosi, eshialo eshilamba nabiosi ebilimwo, tsinyanza nabiosi ebilimwo, khandi niwe oubilinda biosi; nalio lihe eliomwikulu nilikhwinamila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwe niwe OMWAMi, niwe Nyasaye owalobola Aburamu nomurusia muUri liabaKalidayo, nomukulikha eliira mbu Abaruhamu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nonyoola omwoyokwe nikuli omwisiikwa imbeliwo, nolakana ninaye indakano okhuheelesia olwibulolwe eshialo shiabaKanaani, abaHiti, abaAmori, abaPerizi, abaYebusi, nabaGirigashi; nomala nokhola aka wasunga; okhuba oli omulunjishi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi walola obusandibwi bwabakuuka beefwe muMisiri, nohulila tsirmbungu tsiabwe haNyanza Inzakhanyu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nololosia ebilolelo nende akamakana ebia wakholela Farao nabasumbabe bosi, nende abandu bosi abomushibalashie; okhuba wamanya shinga olwa beekhulumamia okhubafukula abakuuka beefwe; niwinyoolela eliira, shinga olwa lili kata leelo luno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakabukhasia inyanza imbeli wabwe, nabo nibabirila hakari weinyanza nibali khwiloba eliumu; nabo ababalondachilila, wabafuuba mulusiba, shinga lichina mumatsi amakhongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi wabeemilila injila mwileesi eliingana isiilo mushiteere, khandi mumulilo okwingana isiilo mushilo, okhubakhosilia injila eya bakhoyile okhulondakhwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi weeshela khushikulu shiaSinai, nosungana ninabo okhurula mwikulu, nobaheelesia obukhalachi obulunji nameebaalo katoto, akalachilisibwa nende amalako amalayi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nobamanyia akeisabatoyo indakatifu, nobalaka amalako, nakalachilisibwa, nameebaalo, mumunwa kwaMusa omusumbawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabaheelesia ebiokhulia ebiarula mwikulu khulwa inzala yabwe, nobarusilia amatsi mulwanda khulwa obuloho bwabwe, nobalaka mbu beenjile babukule eshialo tsana eshia wachinguula omukhono niwitsuba okhubaheelesia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa bo nende abakuuka beefwe beekhulumamia, niboomia amakosi, nibarahulila amalakoko ta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibakhaya okhukakhola; kata shibayeetsulilakhwo akamakana aka wakhola hakari mubo ta; nebutswa niboomia amakosi, nibaraho omwimilisi, mbu bakalushile obunyakhani bwabwe muMisiri. Ne iwe niwe Nyasaye oubeetsanga niwirecheeshe okhuleshelanga; owobukoosia neshisa eshinji, ourali omwangu okhutiilwa oburima ta, owobuheeli oburalilu obunji; kata shiwabalekha tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kata olwa bali nibeekholeele eshimoosi eshisalule, nibasunga mbu Kuno nikwo omunyasayekwo okwakhutikulusia okhurula mushialo shiaMisiri; nibakhola obunyechi obunji; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne mubunji bwetsimbabasi-tsio shiwabalekha mushitsiimi ta; lileesi eliingana isiilo, eliokhubeemilila injila, shiliarula hekulu wabwe mushiteere ta; kata omulilo okwingana isiilo mushilo, okhubakhosilia, nokhubamanyia injila eya bakhoyile okhulondakhwo ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi wabaheelesia Rohowo omulayi okhubeebaalila; kata shiwabeema imanayo muminwa chiabwe ta; nobaheelesia amatsi khulwa obuloho bwabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toto, emiyika amakhumi kane wabaliisilinjia mushitsiimi, nibaratamba eshindu ta; tsingubo tsiabwe shitsiakofula kata ebilenje biabwe okhufwimba tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi wabaheelesia oburuchi bundi nobundi, netsimbia tsiabandu, nobakabila emikabo mungongo tsiosi tsieshialo; kho nibabukula eshialo shiaSihoni, nishio eshialo shiomuruchi waHeshiboni, nende eshialo shiaOgu omuruchi waBashani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaana babwe nabo wabeenjiyia shinga tsinyininyini etsiomwikulu, nobeenjisia mushialo tsana eshia wasunjila abakuuka babwe mbu bakheenjilamwo nibashibukula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho abaana tsana nibeenjilamwo nibabukula eshialo; nawe niwahula imbeli wabwe abo abamenya mushialo, mbu abaKanaani, nobahaana mumakhono kabwe, halala nabaruchi babwe, netsimbia etsiomushialo, mbu babakholele shinga olwa bachama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibabukula nende amataala ketsingoba, neliloba linulu; tsinzu etsieetsula ebindu ebilayi nitsikwa etsiabwe, namayabo kamatsi akayabwa, nemikunda chiemitsabibu nechiemitseituni nemisaala chiebiamo, eminji okhushila; kho nibalia, nibeekura, nibanera, nibeeshieela obunji bwobulayibwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa barenguha, nibakhukholela induli, nibasukuna amalakoko emukongo wabwe, nibeera abanabiibo, ababarumbulila akobuchesiyii okhubakalusia khwiwe, nibakhola obunyechi obunji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako wabahaana mumakhono kabasuku babwe, ababasandia; ne mushise shiamatinyu kabwe, olwa bakhuhaabila wabahulila ewa oli mwikulu; ne obunji bwetsimbabasitsio shinga olwa buli, wabaheelesia abahonia, ababahonia mumakhono kabasuku babwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
