            "verseId": "NEH.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa bali nibahuluushile, bakhola obubii imbeliwo khandi; khulwako wabalekha mumakhono kabasuku babwe, nabo nibaba noburuchi khubo; nebutswa buli olwa bakalukha nibakhuhaabila, wabahulilanga ewa oli mwikulu; akhandi akhanji wabahoninjia khulwa tsimbabasitsio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabarumbulilanga akobuchesiyii, mbu obakalusie khumalakoko; nebutswa beekhulumamia nibarahulilanga amalakoko ta, habula okhwonoonela obukhalachibwo, obwatsana obwa omundu alaba mwoyo mubwo naba nabukholanga; nibatinyia libeka niboomia likosi, nibaloba okhuhulila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata emiyika eminji wabeesimilisilia, nobarumbulila akobuchesiyii muRohowo, muminwa chiabanabiibo; nebutswa baloba okhureka amarwi; ne khulwako wabahaana mumakhono ketsimbia etsiomubialo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa mubunji bwetsimbabasitsio, shiwabatibilia elala kata okhubalekha ta; okhuba oli Nyasaye wobukoosia netsimhahasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
